---
layout: base.njk
title: Page not found
description: That page is not part of the archive.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
permalink: /404.html
---
{% set briefs = collections.brief | reverse %}
<div class="home-grid">
  <article class="brief">
    <header class="brief__head">
      <p class="brief__kicker">404</p>
      <h1 class="brief__title">That page is not in the archive</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The link is wrong, or the issue moved. Every issue lives under its closing Monday, and the archive goes back to January 2026.</p>
      <nav class="brief-nav brief-nav--start" aria-label="Recovery">
        {% if briefs.length %}
        <a class="brief-nav__link" href="{{ briefs[0].url }}">
          <span class="brief-nav__label">Latest issue · Week {{ briefs[0].date | isoWeek }}</span>
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="brief-nav__link" href="/">
          <span class="brief-nav__label">Home</span>
        </a>
        <a class="brief-nav__link" href="/kql/">
          <span class="brief-nav__label">KQL library</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
      <p>Or search the archive from the field in the header.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  {% include "calendar.njk" %}
</div>
